00:21:23,293 --> 00:21:30,093
渡しそびれた心から流れ出た青い雫
From the heart I couldn't ever give, blue drops flowed out...

144
00:21:31,093 --> 00:21:35,393
人様に浴びせるものじゃないの
Something never meant to pour on others.

145
00:21:35,993 --> 00:21:42,593
余すところなく飲み込んで遠海の底に沈んで
Swallowing it all down without a trace, sinking to the bottom of a distant sea,

146
00:21:43,093 --> 00:21:48,893
そのまま宝石にでもなれるのを待つわ
I'll wait there, hoping to become a jewel.

147
00:21:49,593 --> 00:21:56,593
ああ
Ah...

148
00:22:00,293 --> 00:22:06,593
本当は嘘で飾って ごくこみたいな暮らしで慰めて
Decorating truth with lies, comforting myself with a fake life,

149
00:22:07,193 --> 00:22:12,593
誰かの悲劇で自分の悲劇を癒して
healing my own tragedy using someone else's pain.

150
00:22:12,893 --> 00:22:18,893
恋しさに溺れた瞬間のままに
Just as I was, the moment I drowned in yearning,

151
00:22:19,293 --> 00:22:24,593
息もできずただ愛してるの
can't even breathe, just "I love you."

152
00:22:25,293 --> 00:22:31,593
悲しいのは一人で十分だからと これ以上醜くなりたいないのと
"Because sadness is enough for just one, and I don't want to become any uglier..."

153
00:22:32,193 --> 00:22:43,593
私の中で誰にも見付けられずにこんな色になるまで泣いていたんだね 綺麗よ
Unseen by anyone inside of me, you cried until you turned this color, didn't you? You are beautiful.

154
00:22:43,893 --> 00:22:48,593
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

155
00:22:50,593 --> 00:22:58,593
ねぇ 綺麗よ
Hey... you are beautiful.

156
00:23:49,393 --> 00:23:54,393
片っ端で丸を作ってしっかり持ってて
Make a circle with one end and hold it tight.

157
00:23:55,193 --> 00:24:02,093
もう片っ端でその丸の後ろをぐるっと回って
With the other end, go around the back of that circle.

158
00:24:02,993 --> 00:24:08,693
間にできたポッケに入って出てくるの待ってて
Go through the pocket formed in between and wait for it to come out.

159
00:24:08,993 --> 00:24:15,293
出てきたところを迎えに来てさあ「せーの」で引っぺいて
Come meet the end where it comes out, and pull it on the count of three.

160
00:24:16,893 --> 00:24:22,593
はじめはなんとも情けない形だとしても 同じだけ力を込めて
Even if at first, it's a bit of a pathetic shape, apply the same amount of strength.

161
00:24:23,093 --> 00:24:31,593
羽は大きく結び目は固く なるようにきつく結んでいて欲しいの
I want you to tie it tight so the wings are big and the knot is firm.

162
00:24:32,893 --> 00:24:38,593
腕はここに思い出は遠くに 置いておいてほしいの
I want you to keep arms here, and memories far away.

163
00:24:39,093 --> 00:24:45,593
羽は大きく結び目は固く なるようにきつく結んでいて欲しいの
I want you to tie it tight so the wings are big and the knot is firm.

164
00:24:45,893 --> 00:24:49,593
欲しいの
I want you to...

165
00:24:49,893 --> 00:24:59,593
手はここに思い出は遠くに 置いて置いて欲しいの 欲しいの
I want dreams here, and memories far away...

166
00:25:10,332 --> 00:25:12,832
片っ端でも引っ張っちゃえば
If you pull on just one end,

167
00:25:12,832 --> 00:25:15,932
ほどけちゃうけど
it will all come undone,

168
00:25:16,732 --> 00:25:19,432
作ったもの壊すのは
but breaking what you've created

169
00:25:19,432 --> 00:25:22,632
はるかに簡単だけど
is far too easy.

170
00:25:23,132 --> 00:25:26,032
だけど解く時も
Even when untying it,

171
00:25:26,032 --> 00:25:29,132
そうちゃんとさ
you should do it properly,

172
00:25:29,132 --> 00:25:32,632
同じようにね
just like before.

173
00:25:32,819 --> 00:25:36,619
せーので引っ張って
Pulling it together on three!

174
00:25:37,919 --> 00:25:43,319
ほぐれやしないようにと願って力を込めては
Wishing it won't fray, I put my strength into it,

175
00:25:44,319 --> 00:25:48,319
広げすぎた羽に
and get bewildered

176
00:25:49,319 --> 00:25:51,819
戸惑う
by these overly spread wings.

177
00:25:53,319 --> 00:25:56,319
羽根は大きく
The wings are big,

178
00:25:56,319 --> 00:25:59,819
結び目は固く
the knot is firm,

179
00:26:00,619 --> 00:26:07,319
なるように気づく結んでいて欲しいの夢はここに
wishing they'd stay tied so our dreams remain right here.

180
00:26:07,819 --> 00:26:11,819
想い出は遠くに
Memories are far away,

181
00:26:13,819 --> 00:26:21,319
日付もそこにあるくらいがいい
and it's nice if the date is right there too.

182
00:26:24,319 --> 00:26:27,319
結ばって引っ張ったりしないでよ
Don't go pulling on our bonds,

183
00:26:27,319 --> 00:26:30,819
浮かごうが帳尻にしないでよ
don't let them float away or balance out!

184
00:26:31,319 --> 00:26:34,819
結んだつもりがほどいてたり
Thinking we tied them, we were undoing them,

185
00:26:34,819 --> 00:26:38,319
緩めたつもりが締めていたり
thinking we loosened them, we were tightening them.

186
00:27:02,819 --> 00:27:06,819
この青くて広い世界に
In this blue and vast world,

187
00:27:06,819 --> 00:27:10,319
無数に散らばった中から
from the countless scattered paths,

188
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:16,319
別々に二人選んだとを お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
we chose separate ways and pulled them toward each other.

189
00:27:16,819 --> 00:27:19,819
結ばれたんじゃない 結んだんだ
We weren't just bound together; we tied the knot ourselves.

190
00:27:19,819 --> 00:27:23,319
二人でせーので引っ張ったんだ
The two of us pulled together on three!

191
00:27:23,819 --> 00:27:30,319
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
Putting in our strength so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

192
00:27:30,819 --> 00:27:34,319
この青くて広い世界に
In this blue and vast world,

193
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:37,819
無数に散らばった中から
from the countless scattered paths,

194
00:27:37,819 --> 00:27:43,319
別々に二人選んだとを お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
we chose separate ways and pulled them toward each other.

195
00:27:43,819 --> 00:27:46,819
結ばれたんじゃない 結んだんだ
We weren't just bound together; we tied the knot ourselves.

196
00:27:46,819 --> 00:27:50,319
二人でせーので引っ張ったんだ
The two of us pulled together on three!

197
00:27:50,819 --> 00:27:56,819
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
Putting in our strength so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

198
00:28:58,383 --> 00:29:01,883
影にそっと隠れるくらいがいいんじゃない？
Isn't it nice to quietly hide in the shadows?

199
00:29:02,883 --> 00:29:06,883
蕾のような花だっていいんじゃない？
Isn't it fine to be a flower like a bud?

200
00:29:07,983 --> 00:29:11,983
秘密にして守るのがいいんじゃない？
Isn't it good to keep it a secret and protect it?

201
00:29:12,983 --> 00:29:17,683
誰にも邪魔されず華麗に咲いてる
Blooming gorgeously without being bothered by anyone.

202
00:29:18,383 --> 00:29:20,383
甘い苦いにハマんなけりゃ
If you don't get hooked on sweet and bitter,

203
00:29:20,683 --> 00:29:22,883
その判断がクダんない
that judgment is pointless.

204
00:29:23,383 --> 00:29:27,183
気に病んで下を向かないでいて
Don't fret and look down.

205
00:29:28,383 --> 00:29:30,483
愛になりちゃいない
You haven't gotten used to love.

206
00:29:30,683 --> 00:29:32,883
無駄に飾らない
Don't decorate needlessly.

207
00:29:33,183 --> 00:29:35,683
綺麗にされた花瓶も
Even a neatly arranged vase

208
00:29:35,883 --> 00:29:37,683
養分も何もいらない
or any fertilizer isn't needed.

209
00:29:38,383 --> 00:29:41,583
その姿が美しい
That appearance is beautiful.

210
00:29:41,883 --> 00:29:44,983
花になって
Become a flower,

211
00:29:44,983 --> 00:29:48,883
ほらニヒルに笑って その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
smile mockingly, and I can't take my eyes off that thrilling face.

212
00:29:49,183 --> 00:29:51,883
味見して 君の毒は私の薬って
Taste it: your poison is my medicine,

213
00:29:52,383 --> 00:29:55,483
包んであげるから笑って
I'll wrap you up, so smile.

214
00:30:00,834 --> 00:30:02,714
陰にそっと隠れようがいいんじゃない？
It's okay to quietly hide in the shadows, right?

215
00:30:02,814 --> 00:30:04,594
蕾のような花だっていいんじゃない？
Even if you're a budding flower, isn't that fine?

216
00:30:04,994 --> 00:30:06,874
秘密にして守るのがいいんじゃない？
It's good to keep it a secret and protect it, right?

217
00:30:07,094 --> 00:30:09,574
誰にも邪魔されず華麗に咲いている
Blooming magnificently without anyone bothering you

218
00:30:09,794 --> 00:30:11,694
甘い苦いにはまんない
Not too sweet, not too bitter

219
00:30:11,694 --> 00:30:13,594
その判断がくだらない
That judgment is worthless

220
00:30:13,694 --> 00:30:17,794
気に病んで下を向かないでいてね
Don't fret and look down, please

221
00:30:18,294 --> 00:30:21,094
遠くから支えるくらいはいいんじゃない？
Isn't it okay to support you from afar?

222
00:30:23,394 --> 00:30:27,594
欲を言えばこの手で咲かせてみせてよ
If I'm being greedy, make it bloom with these hands

223
00:30:28,194 --> 00:30:32,894
病人のように心を抉らう花
A flower that gouges the heart like a sickness

224
00:30:33,194 --> 00:30:35,794
枯らしたくないのさ
I don't want it to wither

225
00:30:35,994 --> 00:30:40,394
光が届かずとも水をあげ続けるから
Because I'll keep watering it even if light doesn't reach

226
00:30:40,594 --> 00:30:45,494
灯りが届かぬずとも水を絶やすことなく
Even if light doesn't reach, without letting the water run dry

227
00:30:45,694 --> 00:30:50,494
浸し続けつづけるから
I'll keep soaking it...

228
00:30:53,494 --> 00:30:58,194
いい加減に気づいて 君は素敵って
Realize soon, you're wonderful

229
00:30:58,194 --> 00:31:02,794
うぬぼれてもっと大事に
Be more proud and cherish yourself more

230
00:31:03,694 --> 00:31:07,594
綺麗にされた花瓶も 肥料も何も要らない
Don't need a fancy vase or fertilizer

231
00:31:08,094 --> 00:31:12,194
その姿で咲き誇れ花になって
Bloom proudly in that form, become a flower

232
00:31:19,794 --> 00:31:21,794
花になって
Become a flower

233
00:31:22,294 --> 00:31:24,794
ほらニヒルに笑って
Look, smile cynically

234
00:31:24,794 --> 00:31:29,394
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
I can't take my eyes off your thrilling face

235
00:31:29,794 --> 00:31:35,794
味見して君の毒は私の薬って
Taste it, your poison is my medicine

236
00:31:36,294 --> 00:31:39,394
包んであげるから
I'll wrap you up

237
00:31:39,594 --> 00:31:48,294
ねえ逢いたい逢いたい その笑顔に逢いたい逢いたいって言えば笑ってくれるかな
Hey, I want to see you, if I say so will you smile?

238
00:31:48,594 --> 00:31:50,194
笑って
Smile

239
00:32:12,964 --> 00:32:15,964
ドライフラワー
Dry Flower

240
00:32:23,794 --> 00:32:26,294
多分、私じゃなくていいね
Maybe it didn't have to be me

241
00:32:26,294 --> 00:32:29,794
余裕のない二人だったし
Since we were both out of room to care

242
00:32:29,994 --> 00:32:35,394
気づけば喧嘩ばっかりしてさ ごめんね
Before we knew it, we were always fighting. I'm sorry.

243
00:32:35,894 --> 00:32:38,594
ずっと話そうと思ってた
I'd been meaning to talk to you about it

244
00:32:38,594 --> 00:32:41,894
きっと私たち合わないね
I'm sure we just weren't right for each other

245
00:32:42,094 --> 00:32:48,594
二人きりしかいない部屋でさ あなたばかり話していたよね
In a room where it was just the two of us, you were always the only one talking

246
00:32:49,294 --> 00:32:54,394
もしいつか何処かで会えたら 今日の事を笑ってくれるかな
If we ever meet somewhere, I wonder if you'll laugh about today

247
00:32:54,794 --> 00:33:00,794
理由もちゃんと話せないけれど あなたが眠った後に泣くのは嫌
I can't explain the reasons well, but I hate crying after you fall asleep

248
00:33:01,094 --> 00:33:07,294
声も顔も不器用なとこも 全部全部 嫌いじゃないの
Your voice, your face, your clumsiness—I don't hate any of it

249
00:33:07,294 --> 00:33:14,394
ドライフラワーみたい 君との日々も きっときっときっときっと 色褪せる
Like a dry flower, the days with us will surely, surely fade away

250
00:33:14,794 --> 00:33:20,794
声も顔も不器用なとこも 全部全部 嫌いじゃないの
Your voice, your face, your clumsiness—I don't hate any of it

251
00:33:27,694 --> 00:33:32,394
ドライフラワーみたい 君との日々も きっときっときっときっと 色褪せる
Like a dry flower, the days with us will surely, surely fade away

252
00:33:57,794 --> 00:34:03,794
多分君じゃなくてよかった もう流されることもないし
Maybe it's good it wasn't you, I won't be swept away anymore

253
00:34:03,794 --> 00:34:09,794
私ばかりなんて言葉もなくなった
And I stopped saying things like "it's always just me"

254
00:34:10,294 --> 00:34:16,394
あんなに悲しい別れでも 時間がたてば忘れてく
Even such a sad parting will be forgotten as time passes

255
00:34:16,694 --> 00:34:22,594
新しいひとと並ぶ君は ちゃんと上手くやれているのかな
I wonder if you're doing well alongside someone new

256
00:34:22,894 --> 00:34:28,194
もう顔も見たくないからさ 変に連絡してこないでほしい
I don't want to see your face anymore, so don't contact me strangely

257
00:34:28,594 --> 00:34:34,794
都合がいいのは変わってないんだね でも無視できずまた少し返事
You haven't changed, still so convenient. But I can't ignore you and reply a bit.

258
00:34:35,294 --> 00:34:41,594
声も顔も不器用なとこも 多分今も嫌いじゃないの
Your voice, your face, your clumsiness—maybe even now I don't hate them

259
00:34:41,794 --> 00:34:48,294
ドライフラワーみたい 時間が経てば きっときっときっときっと 色褪せる
Like a dry flower, as time passes, it will surely, surely fade away

260
00:34:48,594 --> 00:35:01,464
声も顔も不器用なとこも 全部全部 大嫌いだよ
Your voice, your face, your clumsiness—I truly despise all of it now

261
00:35:02,078 --> 00:35:03,838
たぶん 私じゃなくていいよね
Maybe I'm not the one for you,

262
00:35:04,218 --> 00:35:07,138
余裕のない二人だったし
Since we both had no room to spare,

263
00:35:07,238 --> 00:35:10,038
気付けば喧嘩ばかりしてさ
Before we knew it, we were always fighting.

264
00:35:10,078 --> 00:35:11,038
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

265
00:35:11,058 --> 00:35:12,458
ずっと話そうと思ってた
I'd always intended to talk it over.

266
00:35:28,498 --> 00:35:31,318
月灯りに魔物が揺れる
Monsters sway in the moonlight,

267
00:35:31,318 --> 00:35:34,118
きっと私もどうかしている
I must be losing my mind too.

268
00:35:34,118 --> 00:35:39,858
暗闇に色彩が浮かぶ
Colors float up in the darkness.

269
00:35:41,758 --> 00:35:44,458
赤き色が胸の奥
A crimson hue deep in my chest,

270
00:35:44,458 --> 00:35:47,458
ずっとあなたの名前を呼ぶ
Forever calling out your name.

271
00:35:47,458 --> 00:35:51,958
好きという気持ち また香る
The feeling of love scents the air once more.

272
00:35:53,158 --> 00:35:55,958
声も顔も不器用なところも
Your voice, your face, your clumsiness—

273
00:35:55,958 --> 00:36:05,458
全部全部 大嫌いだよ
I hate every single bit of it.

274
00:36:06,458 --> 00:36:09,458
まだ枯れない花を
Flowers that have yet to wither,

275
00:36:09,458 --> 00:36:12,458
君に添えてさ
I'll offer them to you.

276
00:36:12,458 --> 00:36:17,458
ずっと ずっと ずっと ずっと
Always, always, always, always,

277
00:36:17,458 --> 00:36:19,958
抱えてよ
Hold onto them.

278
00:37:17,798 --> 00:37:21,358
「大丈夫」とまた嘘をついた
I lied again, saying "I'm fine,"

279
00:37:21,358 --> 00:37:24,608
無理してるのか声でわかるよ
I can tell by your voice you're pushing yourself.

280
00:37:24,608 --> 00:37:29,958
バレてるんだよ
You've been found out.

281
00:37:30,758 --> 00:37:33,658
見た目だとか 性格だって 違うあなた
Different in appearance and personality,

282
00:37:33,658 --> 00:37:36,758
だけど 似てるところも 意外とあって
Yet we surprisingly share similarities too.

283
00:37:36,758 --> 00:37:40,158
共鳴 すぐにしなんだ
We resonated with each other right away.

284
00:37:40,158 --> 00:37:42,758
惹かれ合った 私たち
Drawn to one another,

285
00:37:42,758 --> 00:37:45,558
不思議なこの絆
This mysterious bond of ours.

286
00:37:50,458 --> 00:37:53,158
なんとかさ 眠れなくて
Somehow unable to sleep,

287
00:37:53,158 --> 00:37:56,458
夢を語り明かそう
Let's talk about our dreams until dawn.

288
00:37:56,458 --> 00:37:59,758
私がね 頑張れる理由
The reason I can keep trying—

289
00:37:59,758 --> 00:38:02,458
そう 一人じゃないから
That's right, because I'm not alone.

290
00:38:03,258 --> 00:38:06,458
あなたが笑えば 私もつられる
When you smile, I find myself smiling too.

291
00:38:06,458 --> 00:38:09,958
隣り合わせの心 連鎖してるよ
Our side-by-side hearts are linked together.

292
00:38:09,958 --> 00:38:13,158
時には 歩幅が ズレてしまうけど
Sometimes our strides might fall out of sync,

293
00:38:13,158 --> 00:38:15,758
二人 呼吸 揃え
But aligning our breathing,

294
00:38:15,758 --> 00:38:18,958
さあ 未来へと 進んで行こう
Come, let's step forward into the future.

295
00:38:19,158 --> 00:38:22,058
どれくらいの 順位かな 周りと比べて
Wondering where we rank compared to everyone else,

296
00:38:22,058 --> 00:38:25,158
果てしないトラック 先頭 追いつけるの？
Chasing the lead on an endless track—can we catch up?

297
00:38:25,158 --> 00:38:28,458
なんて 弱気な日も 励まし 続けてくれた
Even on such weak-hearted days, you kept encouraging me.

298
00:38:28,458 --> 00:38:31,158
あなたに いつも 感謝
I'm always grateful to you.

299
00:38:31,758 --> 00:38:34,758
転んでても 立ち上がる
Even if we fall, we get back up,

300
00:38:34,758 --> 00:38:37,758
夢を叶えたいんだ
Because we want to make our dreams come true.

301
00:38:37,758 --> 00:38:40,758
こんなにね 打ち込めるのは
The reason we can pour ourselves into this so much

302
00:38:40,758 --> 00:38:42,758
そう 同志がいるから
Is because we have each other, kindred spirits.

303
00:38:43,158 --> 00:38:46,158
あなたの悩みは 私が寄り添う
I will stand close beside your worries,

304
00:38:46,158 --> 00:38:49,158
心が疲れたなら 休息しよう
